	"data": "Room 2.0 MVP — Scaffold: \"See My Stuff\"\n\nPlace visual anchors over physical systems so you can see them all highlighted in AR.\n\nThis scaffold gives you tasks (what to do) and hints (where to look) — not answers. Build it yourself, learn by doing.\n\nThe core build targets Quest 3 (primary), but the architecture is designed so the same ReactXR code can work on Android phones (Chrome WebXR) and, with some extra work, iPhones. Platform specifics are called out where they…",
